{
  "command": "grok-simple",
  "study": "Tie the own-channel mesh layers of the width-64 one-hot ReLU MLP to one stored layer, so that depth D scales each channel by one gain to the power D - 1, after repeating untied own-channel depth 5 to check that tying leaves untied training unchanged",
